I did some more troubleshooting, and I think the issue has to to with the reactiveValuesToList(input) function.  The following code on ShinyApps returns the error, "Results do not have equal lengths"

      output$debug <- renderPrint({

          x <- reactiveValuesToList(input)
          x <- ldply(x)
          x
     })

