Theo,

This seems to be a general question on Shiny rather then ShinyApps, which would be better suited for the shiny-discuss group <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/shiny-discuss>, however I believe I can answer your question: To host Shiny applications, you need to either a) Run Shiny Server or Shiny Server Pro <http://www.rstudio.com/products/shiny/shiny-server/> (Linux only) or b) Signup for ShinyApps <https://www.shinyapps.io/> and host applications in the cloud.

Hope that helps,
-Andy

